+// Function: FPDFText_GetBoundedText
+//          Extract unicode text within a rectangular boundary on the page.
+// Parameters:
+//          text_page   -   Handle to a text page information structure.
+//          Returned by FPDFText_LoadPage function.
+//          left        -   Left boundary.
+//          top         -   Top boundary.
