+// Function: FPDF_SetPrintPostscriptLevel
+//          Set postscript printing level when printing on Windows.
+//          Experimental API.
+// Parameters:
+//          postscript_level- 0 to disable postscript printing,
+//                            2 to print with postscript level 2,
