+//          Set printing mode when printing on Windows.
+//          Experimental API.
+// Parameters:
+//          mode - FPDF_PRINTMODE_EMF to output EMF (default)
+//                 FPDF_PRINTMODE_TEXTONLY to output text only (for charstream
